  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The inverse of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math> (where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>) is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "x3Ghv",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iBteW",
      "text": "not defined for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xfiBl",
      "text": "defined for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "REaO1",
      "text": "None of these",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>,&nbsp;then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;[rationalising]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;[replacing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>]</p><p>Hence, option (a) is correct.</p>",
